WEBVTT

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:09.750
The royal palace employs a
tutor dedicated to giving

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:15.030
its young princes an exhaustive education
to groom them for the throne.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.830
This position is bestowed only
on the best and brightest

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:21.370
educators, specially chosen
from within the kingdom.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.930
They are known as the royal tutor.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:32.880
The Royal Tutor Arrives

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:50.060
Herr Heine Wittgenstein:

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:55.330
I, King of Granzreich, wish to
offer you the position of royal tutor.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:00.500
Happily, I was blessed with one
princess and five princes.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.360
My talented firstborn son is
next in line for the throne.

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:08.320
However, I cannot overlook the possibility
that something may happen to him.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:13.670
Therefore, I would like to install you
as his younger brothers' royal tutor,

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:16.930
to groom them for the throne.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:21.690
In my view, they are still
unfit for kingship.

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:26.740
To prevent their teachers' abilities from
causing inequality in their progress,

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:30.060
I want you alone to oversee their
education. Give them equal attention.

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:35.490
If the four of them mature into worthy
candidates, then at that time...

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:40.850
Boring day after boring day...

00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:43.400
I sure would like a more exciting post.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:44.190
You fool!

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:48.690
We owe this peace to His Majesty,
the King Granzreich himself,

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:53.250
and we're entrusted with guarding the
gates for him. Hold your head high!

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:57.340
Also, today's a special day. We're to
welcome someone summoned by His Majesty.

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:59.580
Oh, yeah!

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:02.160
Erm, this fellow who'll be coming is...

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.830
The royal tutor!

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:14.850
At last, I've arrived at the residence
of the Granzreich royal family.

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:16.650
Weisburg Palace.

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:20.570
Starting today,

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:22.800
I will live here in their
service as the royal tutor,

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.540
for the sake of my own personal goals.

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:28.670
This is my first step.

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:31.530
Stop right there!

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:33.950
Stopped at the first step.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:37.390
That's as far as you go, boy.

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:39.850
Boy? Whom do you mean?

00:02:39.850 --> 00:02:43.920
You, boy. You can't just venture inside
the palace without permission.

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:46.330
It is not without permission.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.700
I have a summons from the king here.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:51.280
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:54.270
I am the new royal tutor, Heine—

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:58.000
I know! You must be the royal tutor's son.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.790
Papa's companion, are you?

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:01.330
Oh, that's all?

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:03.310
Once your papa arrives,
you can go in together.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:06.330
Hmph

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:06.330
I cannot say I expected to
be stopped at the entrance.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.530
What's going on here?

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.710
Oh, my word! There you are,

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:14.930
Professor Heine.

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:15.760
Huh?

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.190
Queen Mother.

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:21.090
Let's leave the stuffy greetings for later.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:24.710
Shall we? I'll show you the way.

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.340
I would be greatly obliged.

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:29.870
"Professor Heine"?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:31.650
I-It couldn't be...

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:34.460
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:38.360
As of today, I am the royal tutor,

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:40.440
Heine Wittgenstein.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:41.730
By the way...

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:45.940
Despite my appearance,
I am a full-grown man.

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:48.350
We're terribly sorry!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:50.930
I'm sorry, my dear.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.740
I should have told them. How rude.

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:55.420
Please pay it no mind.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:58.700
I am already accustomed to
being mistaken for a child.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:05.410
But I was greatly surprised to receive
a letter from His Majesty himself.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:08.210
For me to be summoned to the
royal palace when I am no noble,

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:10.220
merely an ordinary commoner...

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:16.840
Oh, don't say such a thing. The king told me
you are an exceptionally talented teacher.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:20.850
He has specially recognized
your ability, has he not?

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:23.520
Specially...

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:30.220
Oh, Professor! Please, <i>please</i>
take good care of the princes.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:35.690
Actually, their royal tutors
all resign so quickly.

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:38.240
Why they would do such a
thing is a mystery to me.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:42.040
If you'll forgive me for asking, could there
be a problem with the princes themselves?

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:46.300
N-Never! They're all very good boys.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:50.640
Perhaps they were so good that those
tutors had nothing to teach them.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:53.140
I can't think of any other explanation.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.390
Not the blind love of a parent,
but of a grandparent.

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:59.470
I've an inkling that a problem
has been foisted upon me.

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:03.830
Well, so be it. All that matters
to me is that I fulfill this duty.

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:08.020
Whatever their natures may be,
as a professional educator,

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:10.350
I will give the princes a rigorous education.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:13.340
The princes are waiting inside here.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:17.220
Please take good care of them,
Professor Heine.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:34.110
I am honored to meet you, Your Highnesses.

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:37.330
My name is Heine Wittgenstein.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:40.520
As of today, I am Your Highnesses'

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.510
royal tutor.

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:05.950
The honor is ours, Professor Heine.

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:10.130
How beautiful.

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:14.560
Perfect princes, as though they
stepped out of a painting.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:24.380
We're so happy to have you here, Professor...

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:28.150
Is that what you thought I'd say?

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:32.200
Let me set the record straight.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:37.300
Father's orders or not,
you're just a tutor. A commoner.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:42.450
I am the fourth prince of the Kingdom
of Granzreich, Leonhard von Granzreich...

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:45.830
and you will <i>never</i> order me around.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:47.380
Got it?

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:52.120
Beautiful on the outside, but he reveals his
inner arrogance once he opens his mouth.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:54.080
A pride as tall as Everest.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.260
The Everest-Proud Prince.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:59.380
Now that you understand,
you may take your things and—

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:00.150
Professor!

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:01.220
Gotcha!

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:04.400
Hey, are you an adult for real?

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:07.900
You're so little! How tall are you exactly?

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:10.510
Come on, tell me.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:13.670
Damn it, Licht! You interrupted me.

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:18.070
That's not fair, Leo. I wanna talk
to the little professor, too.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.580
You've called me "little." Twice.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.850
I'm Licht von Granzr...

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:27.320
Saying my full name takes
too long. I'm Licht.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:29.380
Feel free to just call me Lichie.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:30.890
"Lichie"?

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:32.220
Yay!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.170
This would be the fifth prince.

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:36.590
So lighthearted, you
wouldn't think him royalty.

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:37.630
The Playboy Prince.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:44.180
Professor... Don't tell me you're
dizzied by my dashing looks?

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:47.190
Oh, boy. I'm so seductive,
they should lock me up.

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:51.050
Seductive, my foot. Obscene is
the word you're looking for.

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.060
That smarts!

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:55.440
Excuse my younger brother's outburst.

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:59.900
As his older brother and the third prince
of the Kingdom of Granzreich, Bruno,

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:02.240
I sincerely apologize.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:08.270
Incidentally, I've read through
some materials about you.

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:11.290
For some reason, your personal
history was completely omitted.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:15.260
Where in the world did you go to university?

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:17.100
Nowhere.

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:18.120
Pardon?

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:21.560
I never went to university.

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:23.550
You don't say.

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:29.500
A very polite boy, but his
gaze just turned very cold.

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.430
The Browbeating Brainiac Prince.

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:33.940
This is the second prince, Kai.

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:41.650
Kai, aren't you going to
greet the royal tutor?

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:49.470
He glared at me.

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:50.790
The Glaring Prince.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:56.900
While it was a bit concerning,
I've now greeted all four princes.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:00.680
Let us strike while the iron is hot.
I will now be interviewing you.

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:01.880
Interviewing us?

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:07.140
I do have some information
about Your Highnesses already.

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.720
What do you mean, information?

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:12.930
Your reputations in the
city, newspaper clippings,

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:17.150
the marks you've earned
at school, and so on.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:18.350
Ooh, what do they say about me?

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:22.350
Do the ladies call me the pretty prince?

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:28.280
I'd like to conduct interviews with each
of you to help me plan your lessons.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:30.290
That won't be necessary.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:34.500
I despise tutors more than anything!

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.150
I don't accept you, got it?

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:40.510
You'll run away like the rest
of them soon enough, anyway.

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:41.840
Agreed.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:46.150
I do not require a so-called royal tutor
who has never even studied at university.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:50.200
Oh, really? Then I'm against you, too.

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:52.140
Not that I care either way.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:56.820
I see.

00:09:57.440 --> 00:10:00.800
So this is the reason why so
many royal tutors ran away.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:04.170
Merely for bearing the title of "tutor,"
they were shunned and rejected,

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.070
completely and utterly.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:10.080
I see where Your Highnesses
stand on this matter.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.840
Now, who will be first?

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.190
Were you listening to me?

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:19.210
I assure you I was.

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:22.370
You do not wish to accept
me as your royal tutor.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:25.380
"Stupid insect. Screw you. Go die." Was it?

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:26.760
I didn't go that far.

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:31.340
It is time for a lesson.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.060
I will not run.

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:41.470
Fulfilling my duties as the
royal tutor is my only concern.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:44.560
Your Highnesses' moods change nothing.

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:51.380
It is not my job to win you over.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:56.160
You refuse to leave, come what may?

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:01.720
Too bad. If we boycott your lessons,
Father will have to listen to us.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:07.970
The four of us will join forces and drive
you out of the position of royal tutor.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:10.310
Uh-oh! Is that the time?

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:14.390
Sorry, Leo. There's a
guest waiting in my room.

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:14.800
Huh?

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.530
Little Professor,

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:19.310
if you want to interview me,
come by after my guest leaves.

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:22.110
This is our special time,
so don't interrupt.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.540
Tschüss!

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:27.020
Licht... That little idiot...

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:30.990
Another woman, I'm sure.
How indecent for a royal.

00:11:31.360 --> 00:11:35.400
W-Well, I was never counting on his help.

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:39.410
My dear brother Bruno,
let's drive out that cocky tutor together!

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:43.650
I do not have time to deal with you.

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:44.170
Yeah!

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:48.360
Nevertheless, you are a
royal tutor sent by Father.

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:49.970
I suppose I can humor one interview.

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:52.290
Come to my room when the clock strikes noon.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:56.040
If you are even a second late,
you can forget about the interview.

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.300
Understood.

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:59.820
N-No way. Bruno?

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:06.750
Get... lo... get... lo...

00:12:08.030 --> 00:12:09.070
Kai...?

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:12.020
Get... lo...

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:14.620
"Get lost"?

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:24.510
Abandoned by all of your brothers?
You poor thing, Prince Leonhard.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.500
Shut up! Don't call me that.

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:32.360
Do not despair. Join me for an
interview. You are not alone.

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:34.790
I told you, I don't want to!

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:37.820
I don't need a stupid royal tutor, period.

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:40.420
Yes, yes. Understood.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:43.890
Let us relocate to Your Highness's room.

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:45.780
No!

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:49.960
The fourth prince, Leonhard.
Fifteen years old.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:52.940
His reputation as the most beautiful
boy on the western continent

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:56.740
earned him the name
"The White Lily of Granzreich."

00:12:56.740 --> 00:13:03.380
He never boasts of his appearance,
and is humble and kind to all.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:07.100
Or so my research would lead me to believe.

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:08.710
What are you looking at?

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:11.350
Do you have something to say to me?

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.560
The real thing is a terribly
Everest-proud prince.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.570
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:21.510
I let you into my room,
but I don't accept you as the royal tutor.

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:23.030
I assure you, I am well aware.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:27.100
The purpose of this interview is to learn
more about the prince's temperament.

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:32.700
My other goal is to measure his
academic ability with a competency test.

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:36.750
I doubt he will obediently take the test...

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:40.700
Perhaps I'll ask him to after a brief chat.

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:45.000
Your Highness.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:48.840
You have found me unpleasant
since you first saw me, yes?

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.000
Obviously!

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.810
I told you. I hate teachers.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:14:00.620
I've done nothing to you,
yet you reject me so strongly.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:01.740
Is there a specific reason—

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:02.470
Silence!

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:06.920
For me, the very fact that you are
a tutor makes you despicable.

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:09.440
Teachers... Ooh, teachers...

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:13.680
I hate them as much as
I hate carrots and bell peppers!

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:16.200
I've suddenly been added to
the vegetable food group.

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:20.080
Your Highness, do you dislike
carrots and bell peppers?

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.130
S-So what if I do?

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.700
Your Highness is surprisingly childish.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:30.130
How dare you! I'm fifteen.
I'm a magnificent adult!

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:32.900
I can't spoil my appetite for dinner,

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:36.890
so every evening I hold back from
eating sachertorte, my favorite.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.550
How do you like that? Very adult, yes?

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.980
That is magnificent.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:41.900
For a child.

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:46.700
Sachertorte... sachertorte... I want some...

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:49.150
You love sachertorte that much, do you?

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:52.900
But why do you dislike teachers that much?

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.910
That's none of your business.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:59.390
Unless I understand, I cannot do better.

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:03.750
As the royal tutor,
I would like to build trust with—

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.920
Teachers can't be trusted!

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:14.340
No teacher has ever truly paid attention to me.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:18.150
They're always too busy
paying attention to Father's mood.

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:24.090
Aha. He's burdened by complex emotions
that come with his princely station.

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:25.680
And most of all...

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:27.930
I hate studying.

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:30.610
Teachers force me to study.
Therefore, they're my enemy.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.150
Or it's not complex emotions, after all.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:38.030
Well, what kinds of lessons have you
had with the previous royal tutors?

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.440
I've been running from them.

00:15:39.440 --> 00:15:40.700
That is too blunt.

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:42.740
Sometimes at a full-speed sprint.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:44.580
P-Prince Leonhard!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.540
Other times on horseback.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.670
Prince Leonhard!

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:51.990
It gave me skill and stamina.

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:53.900
These are the trophies my
physical prowess won for me.

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:55.630
Athletics are the only thing in his head.

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:59.320
Hmph. So? Terrified by my talents?

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.320
You could say so, in more than one way.

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:04.820
To think he hates studying to this extent...

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:08.840
If I ask him to take my test,
will he run outright?

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:12.540
Your Highness, occasionally you must
feel in the mood to study...

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:15.680
Or not.

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:18.350
Studying—

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:22.240
Is something you hate, indeed.

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:25.810
What?

00:16:25.810 --> 00:16:27.450
Oh, nothing.

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:31.520
To tell the truth, I have a pop quiz—

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:38.600
You can keep up with my sprint? Not bad.

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:41.040
I'd like you to take this test.

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:45.230
Don't worry. It only covers basic
problems in language and mathematics.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:48.290
No way, no how! I can't believe
you were hiding a test.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:51.620
I knew teachers couldn't be trusted.
Out of my way!

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:53.360
No need to throw a tantrum.

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:56.960
Damn it. You leave me no choice.

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:01.270
You dropped something.

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:04.870
Hey! Give it here!

00:17:06.270 --> 00:17:07.130
Step, step, step, step, step.

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:08.420
Roll, roll, roll.

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:09.930
A diary?

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:13.420
Today's regret...

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.060
When the maid brought my melange,

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:18.030
I couldn't say "thank you" again.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:20.780
I'm hopeless. A lost cause.

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:23.650
I don't deserve to live.

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:26.050
An intensely negative diary.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:28.330
Today's regret...

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:32.770
I ruined the book Bruno lent me.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:33.890
I want to die.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.830
This is a reflective diary, then?

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.400
Come out here, you coward!

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:40.250
Prince Leonhard.

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:43.280
You keep a reflective diary?

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:45.990
No, that's...

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:51.410
Right, that's my brother's diary! My baby
brother Licht must have left it in my room.

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:54.960
I see. I will return it to him, then.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:58.500
Give it back.

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:01.320
Will you take your test?

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:02.800
I told you I won't.

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:04.610
"Today's regret...

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:09.290
I picked the bell peppers out of
my dinner. Oh, how awful I am."

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:10.480
Stop it!

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:13.980
"Today's regret...

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:18.260
I ran away from my lessons yet
again. Why do I always..."

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:21.180
Fine! I won't run. I'll take your test!

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:24.290
I promise! So cut it out,
you sadist teacher!

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:31.100
I'm not made of time, you know.
Why should I take this stupid test?

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:41.850
As a prince, I order you to tell
me the answer to number one.

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:44.550
If I told you the answers,
it would not be a test.

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:48.220
I hate your guts.

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:02.390
Once he begins, he tackles
it seriously, at least.

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:09.830
I'm not good at socializing.

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:14.260
I tend to run away from my
lessons and things I dislike,

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:16.300
but I want to fix that
part of me bit by bit.

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:21.410
I want to become a magnificent
person like Bruno one day.

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:29.220
One wouldn't imagine the Everest-proud
prince to have a sensitive side.

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:32.340
Perhaps he's merely a
scared child, deep down.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:36.900
His overblown pride is a
front to hide his frailty.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:42.950
You cannot grow if you always fear being
hurt and run away from reality, Your Highness.

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:45.870
Here. Happy now?

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:49.110
Thank you. I have indeed
received your answer sheet.

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:54.330
I will see you in the reception
hall at four o'clock.

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:55.620
As if I'd go.

00:19:55.620 --> 00:20:01.690
His Majesty the King instructed me to give
equal attention to all four of Your Highnesses.

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:07.510
I will only begin my lessons if I
am able to gather you all together.

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:11.620
I don't need a royal tutor, got it? Get out!

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:12.930
Is that so?

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:20.310
Huh? He actually left? Huh?

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:25.540
I mean, I didn't want him to stick around,
but it ticks me off that he left so quickly...

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:27.790
Gah! He's making a fool of me!

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:31.620
If that's how it's going to be,
maybe I'll complain to Father, Heine!

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:47.290
I thought that if anyone ever read
my diary, they'd laugh at me.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:54.140
Stupid sadist teacher thinks he can read
my private thoughts. Good riddance!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:59.100
So he's back? Well, it's already too late.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:03.310
I guess I can humor him this once.

00:21:03.310 --> 00:21:04.350
Come in.

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:08.420
Pardon me.

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:12.150
Here is what Your Highness requested.

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:15.540
Huh? I didn't ask for anything.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:20.540
Huh? But... I was instructed to
serve this to Your Highness.

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.370
"Thank you for your hard work."

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:40.540
I-I guess I don't have to tell Father.

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:43.630
But I won't put up with him again.

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:48.360
Sachertorte is so yummy...

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:54.810
I'll only baby you today, Your Highness.

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:58.510
Now, the next prince is...

00:22:02.390 --> 00:22:04.390
Heine Wittgenstein.

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:08.250
You have nothing to teach me.

00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:42.910
Carrots, bell peppers...
Those aren't fit for human consumption!

00:23:42.910 --> 00:23:45.770
What if you tried alternating between bites
of a food you like and one you don't?

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:48.300
That's it! If I ate it with sachertorte...

00:23:48.300 --> 00:23:49.960
Next time, "The Prince Interviews."

00:23:48.780 --> 00:23:53.770
Next Time:
The Prince Interviews

00:23:49.960 --> 00:23:51.660
So? How's it taste?

00:23:52.210 --> 00:23:53.900
Still terrible...
